  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "With **LEGIONES DAEMONICA** as your [Army Faction](vsdata:core-rule/select-army-faction), these areas are in your army's Shadow of Chaos:\n\n- Your deployment zone, for the whole battle.\n- No Man's Land, for any phase that starts with you holding half or more of its objective markers.\n- The enemy deployment zone, for any phase that starts with you holding half or more of its objective markers.\n\n**DAEMONIC MANIFESTATION**: **[Battle-shock rolls](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock)** by your **LEGIONES DAEMONICA** units in the Shadow get +1. If the roll passes, one of the unit's models heals D3 wounds; a **BATTLELINE** unit may instead return as many as D3 **destroyed** models, never **CHARACTER** models.\n\n**DAEMONIC TERROR**: an enemy unit in the Shadow, or within 6″ of any of your **SKARBRAND**, **ROTIGUS**, **SHALAXI HELBANE**, **LORD OF CHANGE**, **GREAT UNCLEAN ONE**, **KEEPER OF SECRETS**, **BLOODTHIRSTER** or **KAIROS FATEWEAVER** units, gets −1 on each [Battle-shock test](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock) and suffers D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** whenever it fails one.",
